@title 3D view: EMC view with the magnetic field estimate on the plate
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# 3D > EMC: the Exposure map layer shows the field slice (model) with the microtesla ends in the legend and the Estimate card for the PLC.
open qa/fixtures/emc-field.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 60
# Under load the first click can land before the toolbar answers: click again (a click on the active 3D tab changes nothing).
click_text 3D #1
wait 40
click 24 464
wait 60
click_text "Exposure map" #1
wait 15
# At 1366x768 the 3D legend sits collapsed in the corner (its triangle is at 82 652); at 1920x1080 it is open and this click lands on the empty scene.
click 82 652
wait 15
expect "Magnetic field of the drawn currents"
shot emc-field-3d
check_layout
click_text "Field at sensitive device" #1
wait 15
expect "Field at the device"
shot emc-field-3d-card
check_layout
